> Is there any way to improve the mithril coat so that I get
> to keep the same AC without extra burden? The guide book mentions
> something about enchanting items but I have no idea how that works.

Yes, there are specific scrolls that do that. You can imagine that the
scrolls will have different effects if they are cursed, uncursed, or
blessed. And you should keep in mind that it would be unbalancing to
enchant any item too often, so the game has some limits built in.
(Advanced information: I wouldn't necessarily enchant the mithril coat
if I knew there is better armor around - no, not crystal. So I probably
enchant that piece of armour that I want to keep throughout the game;
probably some magic boots, or magic gloves, or... - dragon armor?)

