> Also, I am running out of arrows, at least the good ones, what do I do
> if I do not find a shop selling arrows soon?

Well, you've certainly met monsters that fire arrows? - Kill them!
Or did you find arrow traps? - Be creative to get them "all" without
stepping onto the trap!

> On a related note, can
> arrows be cursed, if yes how that affect me, if it does at all?

Yes, all items can be cursed. Cursed arrows will not be working as you
wish they would; they are less effective, sometimes unreliable when
firing. You can use them as a last resort. (Advanced information: You
can "modify" your arrows to make them less likely disappear.)

